msgstr "Bật SELinux để kiểm soát truy cập bắt buộc"

#: crates/linux-defender-core/src/audit.rs:956
#: crates/linux-defender-core/src/audit.rs:967
msgid "SELinux status could not be determined"
msgstr "SELinux status could not be determined"

#: crates/linux-defender-core/src/audit.rs:994
